  "paragraphs": [
    "A 3D transition that moves the top layer out of the frame in a chosen direction while the second layer unfolds itself into the frame moving right, left, upward, or downward.",
    "Use the four Unfold presets — one for each direction — for single-click setup of your origami-esque transitions. Simply keyframe the Mix duration (see below)&#160;and tune to taste! Find these presets via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
    "As with all other Universe tools, you can modify or create a Unfold look and then save it under its own name by pressing the Save Preset... button."
  ],
